103
00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:49.760
In Canada, federal support will lift
Woodfibre LNG's capacity to about

104
00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:52.240
two and a half million tonnes a year.

105
00:05:52.320 --> 00:05:56.080
And Shell has delivered first gas
from its Rosmari-Marjoram development

106
00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:56.880
off Malaysia.

107
00:05:57.440 --> 00:06:01.600
What to watch next. Daily EU storage
readings through the twenty-fifth,

108
00:06:01.680 --> 00:06:04.160
as the forecast cold spell arrives.

109
00:06:04.320 --> 00:06:07.760
Then on the twenty-fifth, the EIA's
weekly figures for the week to the

110
00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:09.120
